mockstudio (1.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Flows tab: multi-step, concurrent traffic scenarios with live
    throughput, error rate and latency percentiles.
  * Lower memory and CPU under traffic: capped log bodies, batched UI
    updates, cached route matching and templating, pooled proxy client.
  * Fixes for proxy gzip/binary bodies, connection-reset faults, binary
    request bodies, project import ids, tunnel shutdown and atomic saves.

