mockstudio (1.0.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Mock Studio by dhiva labs: a production-grade mock
    server desktop app. Design HTTP endpoints visually and run a real
    shelf-based server with conditional rules, response sequences,
    weighted randomness, templating, latency and fault injection, a live
